    },
    {
      "id": "claim_92ceff896335478ab05831567a12dfaf",
      "statement": "The active auto-configured `JwtServiceAdapter` generates UUID refresh tokens, but `AuthService.refresh` calls `extractUserEmail` and that adapter always parses its argument as a signed JWT; therefore a stored UUID refresh token cannot complete the refresh workflow.",
