    {
      "id": "claim_081aa0aa2d094f11b64a032681590625",
      "statement": "The persisted refresh record has a core-enforced seven-day expiry, whereas `DefaultJwtTokenService` gives a JWT refresh token an independently configurable expiry; implementations must keep these two acceptance policies consistent.",
