      "id": "claim_c2d03041d6b74325906558184cef05fc",
      "statement": "The JPA refresh adapter stores the token as the `refresh_tokens` primary key with user ID, expiry, and revoked state, and revocation marks an existing entity; the in-memory fallback instead removes the entry.",
