      "id": "claim_926876fbfbc743bca909ca1e8c51c772",
      "statement": "Both supplied blacklist implementations are process-local: the fallback retains token strings indefinitely, while `TokenBlacklistAdapter` stores expiry in a concurrent map and removes expired entries only when checked.",
